{
  "_note": [
    "The bundled open-source pack: game entries pinned to an upstream commit, each one carrying",
    "the evidence its licence demands. Nawras\\Providers\\OssPack verifies every entry with the",
    "SAME LicensePolicy that guards the live catalogue, in EXPORT mode, because a pack is by",
    "definition redistributed.",
    "Entries 1-7 are REAL upstreams curated on 2026-09-05: each commit_sha is the tip of the",
    "repo's default branch at capture time, and each license_sha256 is the SHA-256 of the",
    "licence file bytes at exactly that commit (raw.githubusercontent.com content). Re-pin a",
    "game by updating commit_sha + license_sha256 together and refreshing captured_at.",
    "Entries 8-10 are deliberately broken FIXTURES so the gate can be seen rejecting them",
    "(tools/prove_runtime.py asserts each rejection); they are not games and never ship:",
    "  ghost-maze  -> missing licence hash   -> rejected 'incomplete'",
    "  turbo-drift -> single-site licence  -> rejected 'no_redistribution' in export mode",
    "  void-runner -> unknown licence type -> rejected 'unknown_license_type'"
  ],
